        target fully contains the objective axis but is one level away from the felt-sensation framing.
        Moderate tier : direct term-and-scope match (abdominal distension = feeling bloated),
        term-verified active, but a real framing gap between the subjective ICF and the objective SNOMED CT
        finding, and no independent Athena crosswalk re-verified.
        """
}
